  "description": "Decode and render DICOM images with Plgic.Dicom: native and compressed pixel data (RLE, JPEG baseline / extended / lossless, JPEG-LS, JPEG 2000) in pure managed code, modality and VOI LUTs (window center/width LINEAR, LINEAR_EXACT, SIGMOID, LUT sequences), MONOCHROME1/2, RGB, YBR and PALETTE COLOR, multi-frame, thumbnails, and PNG / JPEG export. Free for evaluation, non-commercial use and small companies (under USD 1M annual revenue); commercial production use by larger organisations needs a paid license. No license key required today.",
